  "id": 3308,
  "name": "Tura Residence",
  "overview": "##### Project General Facts\n\nTura Residence is a boutique residential development designed for those who appreciate refined architecture, thoughtful spatial planning, and a lifestyle centered on calm and balance. Rising with an elegant mid-rise profile, the project presents an intimate residential collection with a limited number of homes, creating an exclusive living environment where privacy and comfort are paramount. The building configuration offers a carefully curated mix of one-, two-, and three-bedroom residences, each crafted to maximize space, natural light, and everyday functionality. With its design-led philosophy, the development emphasizes timeless aesthetics and practical layouts that support both contemporary lifestyles and long-term value.\n\nThe project is enriched with a carefully selected range of lifestyle amenities that elevate daily living and create a relaxing residential environment. Residents can enjoy a stunning infinity swimming pool designed for leisure and relaxation, a fully equipped fitness gym supporting active lifestyles, and a dedicated yoga studio that encourages wellness and mindfulness. Landscaped gardens and tranquil outdoor seating areas offer peaceful spaces to unwind, while the sauna provides an additional layer of relaxation. Families benefit from thoughtfully designed children's play areas, while social spaces such as the BBQ area encourage community gatherings and outdoor entertainment. Altogether, these amenities form a balanced lifestyle environment focused on wellbeing, comfort, and recreation.\n\nInside the residences, attention to detail is reflected through elegant interior finishes and refined material selections. Living and dining areas are conceived as open and fluid spaces, allowing natural light to flow freely while supporting both everyday living and relaxed entertaining. Kitchens feature modern layouts with integrated storage and quality finishes that combine clean design with practical functionality. Bedrooms are designed as calm private retreats, characterized by soft tones, refined textures, and spacious layouts that promote rest and relaxation. Bathrooms complement the living spaces with minimalist lines, high-quality materials, and a sophisticated palette that transforms everyday routines into a refined experience of comfort and tranquility.\n\n##### Location Description and Benefits\n\nSituated in the vibrant district of Meydan, the area offers a rare balance between urban accessibility and residential tranquility. Known for its master-planned environment and continuous growth, Meydan has rapidly become one of Dubai’s most attractive residential destinations, combining modern infrastructure with a relaxed community atmosphere.\n\nThe district enjoys exceptional connectivity to some of the city's most important destinations. Major commercial and lifestyle hubs such as Business Bay, Dubai Design District, and the financial center Dubai International Financial Centre are all easily accessible within a short drive. Iconic landmarks including the world-famous Burj Khalifa and the vibrant Downtown Dubai district are also nearby, allowing residents to enjoy world-class shopping, dining, and entertainment experiences.\n\nAnother significant advantage of the location is its convenient access to transportation infrastructure, including proximity to Dubai International Airport. This ensures seamless connectivity for both business professionals and frequent travelers. At the same time, the surrounding environment remains peaceful and residential in character, offering green spaces, wide boulevards, and thoughtfully planned communities. The result is a location that perfectly balances convenience, accessibility, and a refined urban lifestyle.",
