  "developer_data": {
    "id": 663,
    "name": "Namat Real Estate Development",
    "description": "Namat Real Estate Development is an emerging Dubai-based property developer, focused on creating modern, thoughtfully designed residential and commercial projects. Established in the UAE, Namat combines real estate development with strategic advisory services, offering a holistic approach to property projects from concept to completion.  Headquartered in Al Quoz, one of Dubai’s most dynamic commercial hubs, Namat leverages its location to collaborate with architects, investors, and contractors, ensuring every project aligns with market trends and investor expectations. The company emphasizes quality, innovation, and sustainability, aiming to deliver developments that enhance lifestyle while generating long-term value for owners and investors.",
